      "observation": "All clips retain the same project-original Reef Spitter grammar: eyeless elongated dome, blue-black/blue-green chitin, aquatic dorsal plates, yellow sub-throat acid gland, two arms, two digitigrade legs and one tail. No visible identity swap, weapon, biological cannon or extra creature.",
