        "observation": "Eight distinct grounded locomotion poses preserve direction and alternating limb placement; the gait change is visually subtle but not a duplicate-state sheet."
      },
      "attack": {
        "status": "pass-with-reserve",
        "observation": "Crouch, gland inflation, mouth release cue, recoil and recovery are legible. Gland volume briefly changes non-monotonically around the middle anticipation/release transition, so artistic continuity still needs explicit human acceptance even though strict extraction passes."
      },
      "death": {
        "status": "visual-pass-technical-strict-block",
        "observation": "Standing recoil progresses through loss of support, curl/fall and three terminal prone settling poses. The sequence is terminal rather than a reusable hurt loop; its frame-2/frame-3 tail overlap remains the strict technical blocker."
